     sumti       ek*      gek     joik*      joigik
     bridi-tails gihek*   gek     ---        joigik
     termsets    ek*      gek     joik*      joigik
     tanru parts jek      guhek   joik*      ---
     operands    ek*      gek     joik*      joigik
     operators   jek      guhek   joik       ---
     tenses/modals   jek      ---     joik       ---
